  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "fb-2OtbphED",
      "time": 11,
      "shotId": "05",
      "address": "animatic:shot.05",
      "text": "このショットないほうが自然な気がする。消したいな",
      "displayedVariants": {
        "animatic:shot.05.first": "v-IHq94N7W"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-GzsLaMmN",
      "time": 26.666666666666668,
      "shotId": "10",
      "address": "animatic:shot.10",
      "text": "ここの始まり、And じゃなくて、Okay のほうが自然じゃないかな？どう思う？",
      "displayedVariants": {
        "animatic:shot.10.first": "v-IKTvbuHN",
        "animatic:shot.10.vo0": "v-5ZCrFAEM",
        "animatic:shot.10#composition": "v-nLnzk6go"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-BGLLzJcw",
      "time": 72,
      "shotId": "28",
      "address": "animatic:shot.28",
      "x": 0.424,
      "y": 0.599,
      "text": "タブレットがでかすぎ。画角はこのままでいい",
      "displayedVariants": {
        "animatic:shot.28.first": "v-rvgSV3c7"
      }
    }
